abstract: "NTransformer is an independently developed, PyTorch-based, decoder-only Transformer architecture and training framework by Neuratal. It implements the model, inference helpers, a training engine and checkpoint machinery with a deliberately minimal dependency surface, NTokenizer v0.3-polished compatibility (vocabulary 262,144, token IDs consumed verbatim), and honest, measurement-first documentation. No pretrained weights are distributed with this release."
